Included Files:

List.c:        		 Source code for the List ADT.
Graph.c:       		 Source code for the Graph ADT.
FindComponents.c:    Source code for the FindComponents program. Contains Main.
GraphTest.c:   		 Source code for the test program for the Graph ADT.

List.h:       Include .h file for the necessary List ADT functions.
Graph.h:      Include .h file for the necessary Graph ADT functions.
makefile:     Makefile for included executables. Usage instructions inside.
README:       Usage and instructions for the program.

USAGE:

Run "make" to create FindComponents executable.
Run by using the command:
	FindComponents <infile> <outfile>
The FindComponents program accepts vertices and edges in the infile, performs 
Depth First Search on the created graph, and then writes the resulting
strongly connected components to the outfile. 

Notes about the assignment:
	"Visit" function was implemented using a local "time" variable in DFS(),
	which is passed by reference to the visit function.

Other make commands:
	make clean: removes generated files
	make GraphTest: makes the GraphTest executable
		run with: GraphTest
	make check: runs valgrind on FindComponents, testing for memory leaks.
		    requires files "infile" and "outfile" for testing.

